        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaabaire atakataahire, Yehu mwene Hanani omuhanuuzi yaaza kumubugana, yaamugira ati: Oshemereire kuha ababi emikono, n'okukunda abarikwanga MUKAMA? N'ahabw'ekyo ekiniga kya MUKAMA kyakwijaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
